Shaders have always caught my eye, but most existing web tools are either paywalled or too clunky for quick experimentation. Instead of bouncing between different sites that didn't fit my workflow, I decided to build my own exploration tool.

That’s how **FFFX** was born. Inspired by TouchDesigner and node-based visual tools, it lets you feed in an image, GIF, video, or live webcam and stack customizable effect and shader presets in layers. It’s been a blast to build.

